{'symbol': 'EMN', 'date': '2022-09-20 08:42:00', 'title': 'EASTMAN TO ADVANCE A CIRCULAR FUTURE FOR HEALTHCARE PACKAGING WITH KEY COLLABORATION', 'text': 'ETHICON TO SOURCE EASTMAN RENEW MATERIALS IN INDUSTRY-LEADING MOVE TO HELP REDUCE PLASTIC WASTE IN HEALTHCARE KINGSPORT, TENN. , SEPT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EASTMAN (NYSE: EMN) HAS ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT WITH ETHICON*, A JOHNSON & JOHNSON MEDTECH** COMPANY, TO SOURCE EASTMAN RENEW MATERIALS FOR ITS MEDICAL DEVICE STERILE-BARRIER PACKAGING.'}